        {
          "_type": "ClassDef",
          "_fields": {
            "name": "HOP5_GenerationAgent",
            "bases": [],
            "keywords": [],
            "body": [
              {
                "_type": "Expr",
                "_fields": {
                  "value": {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\n    v13.0: Generation Agent - N-candidate generation only\n    \n    BREAKING CHANGE from v12.0:\n    - OLD: Generation + validation + retry logic all in one\n    - NEW: Only generates N candidates, writes to state\n    - Validation moved to HOP-6\n    - Retry decision moved to HOP-7\n    \n    Single Responsibility: Generate message candidates\n    \n    Input:  state/2_research_context.json, state/3_sender_grounding.json, state/4.5_scaffold.json\n    Output: state/5_generated_drafts.json\n    ",
                      "kind": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 333,
                    "_col_offset": 4
                  }
                },
                "_lineno": 333,
                "_col_offset": 4
              },
